      "id": "6dd7622d702c-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "If x 2 + 2&radic;3x + 4 = 0, then what is the value of (x 7 + x 6 + 64x + 80)? &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x 2 + 2&radic;3x + 4 = 0, &#2340;&#2379; (x 7 + x 6 + 64x + 80) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x<sup>2</sup> + 2&radic;3x + 4 = 0, then what is the value of (x<sup>7</sup> + x<sup>6</sup> + 64x + 80)?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x<sup>2</sup> + 2&radic;3x + 4 = 0, &#2340;&#2379; (x<sup>7</sup> + x<sup>6</sup> + 64x + 80) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "32 32",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">32</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">32</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "16 16",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">16</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">16</span>"
        },
        {
