      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If k + 1/k  -  2 = 0 and k &gt; 0, then what is the value of k<sup>15</sup> + 1/k<sup>11</sup>? </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; k + 1/k - 2 = 0 &#2324;&#2352; k &gt; 0, &#2340;&#2379; k<sup>15</sup> + 1/k<sup>11</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
